### ============================================
### 🔐 AUTHENTICATION
### ============================================

### Login ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hei.mg",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200) {
        client.global.set("access_token", response.body.token);
        client.log("✅ Token ADMIN récupéré: " + response.body.token.substring(0, 20) + "...");
    } else {
        client.log("❌ Erreur login: " + response.status);
    }
%}

### Login STUDENT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jean.rakoto@hei.mg",
  "password": "Student123!"
}

### Login TEACHER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "herimanana.rabe@hei.mg",
  "password": "Teacher123!"
}


### ============================================
### 📚 PROMOTIONS (ADMIN requis)
### ============================================

### Créer une promotion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Promotion 2026",
  "startYear": 2023,
  "endYear": 2026
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("promotionId", response.body.id);
        client.log("✅ Promotion créée avec ID: " + response.body.id);
    }
%}

### Lister toutes les promotions
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Récupérer une promotion par ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/{{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### ============================================
### 👥 GROUPS (ADMIN requis)
### ============================================

### Créer un groupe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Groupe A1",
  "promotionId": "{{promotionId}}"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("groupId", response.body.id);
        client.log("✅ Groupe créé avec ID: " + response.body.id);
    }
%}

### Lister les groupes d'une promotion
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups?promotionId={{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Récupérer un groupe par ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/groups/{{groupId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### ============================================
### 👨‍🏫 TEACHERS (ADMIN requis)
### ============================================

### Créer un enseignant
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Herimanana",
  "lastName": "Rabe",
  "email": "herimanana.rabe@hei.mg"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("teacherId", response.body.id);
        client.log("✅ Enseignant créé avec ID: " + response.body.id);
    }
%}

### Lister tous les enseignants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Récupérer un enseignant par ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teachers/{{teacherId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### ============================================
### 📖 COURSES (ADMIN requis)
### ============================================

### Créer un cours
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Algorithmique",
  "code": "ALG1"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("courseId", response.body.id);
        client.log("✅ Cours créé avec ID: " + response.body.id);
    }
%}

### Lister tous les cours
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Récupérer un cours par ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Affecter enseignant à cours/groupe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses/teaching-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "teacherId": "{{teacherId}}",
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "academicYear": "2025-2026"
}


### ============================================
### 👨‍🎓 STUDENTS (ADMIN requis)
### ============================================

### Créer un étudiant
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "std": "HEI-2023-014",
  "firstName": "Jean",
  "lastName": "Rakoto",
  "email": "jean.rakoto@hei.mg",
  "promotionId": "{{promotionId}}",
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("studentId", response.body.id);
        client.log("✅ Étudiant créé avec ID: " + response.body.id);
    }
%}

### Lister les étudiants d'une promotion
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students?promotionId={{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Récupérer un étudiant par ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Réaffecter un étudiant à un nouveau groupe
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students/group-assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}",
  "startDate": "2025-09-01"
}

### Historique des groupes d'un étudiant
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/{{studentId}}/group-history
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### ============================================
### 📊 GRADES (TEACHER ou ADMIN)
### ============================================

### Ajouter une note
POST http://localhost:8080/api/grades
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "academicYear": "2025-2026",
  "value": 14.5
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 201) {
        client.global.set("gradeId", response.body.id);
        client.log("✅ Note créée avec ID: " + response.body.id);
    }
%}

### Lister les notes d'un étudiant
GET http://localhost:8080/api/grades?studentId={{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Modifier une note (raison obligatoire)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/grades/{{gradeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 16.0,
  "reason": "Correction après réclamation de l'étudiant"
}

### Historique des modifications d'une note
GET http://localhost:8080/api/grades/{{gradeId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### ============================================
### 🎓 GRADUATES (ADMIN requis)
### ============================================

### Classement des diplômés d'une promotion
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/{{promotionId}}/graduates
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Export Excel du classement
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/{{promotionId}}/graduates/export
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Classement multi-promotions - 3 ans
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/{{promotionId}}/graduates/results?promotionIds={{promotionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### ============================================
### 📄 TRANSCRIPTS
### ============================================

### Générer un relevé PDF (retourne URL S3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transcripts/generate?studentId={{studentId}}&academicYear=2025-2026
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Envoyer un relevé par email (asynchrone POJA)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transcripts/send
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}",
  "academicYear": "2025-2026"
}


### ============================================
### 🔒 SECURITY TESTS (401/403)
### ============================================

### Accès sans token - 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students

### Token invalide - 401 Unauthorized
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

### STUDENT accède à un autre étudiant - 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/STD99999
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### STUDENT modifie une note - 403 Forbidden
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/grades/{{gradeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "value": 18.0,
  "reason": "Test"
}

### STUDENT crée un enseignant - 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teachers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Forbidden",
  "email": "test.forbidden@hei.mg"
}

### TEACHER crée un étudiant - 403 Forbidden
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "std": "HEI-FORBIDDEN",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Forbidden",
  "email": "test.forbidden@hei.mg",
  "promotionId": "{{promotionId}}",
  "groupId": "{{groupId}}"
}

### TEACHER accède aux diplômés - 403 Forbidden
GET http://localhost:8080/api/promotions/{{promotionId}}/graduates
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### ============================================
### 🌐 THYMELEAF (sans authentification)
### ============================================

### Page listant les promotions
GET http://localhost:8080/promotions

### Page détail d'une promotion
GET http://localhost:8080/promotions/{{promotionId}}

### Export Excel depuis Thymeleaf
GET http://localhost:8080/promotions/{{promotionId}}/export